# Skyclave Apparition: "the exiled card's owner creates an X/X blue Illusion creature token" - the token is X/X as it is made
# (CR 111.4), never a 0/0 for a moment. Bot1's Apparition exiles Bot2's Ulvenwald Oddity (mana value 4); Bot2 bolts the
# Apparition, and the 4/4 Illusion it gets is seen entering with power 4 by Bot2's Outcaster Trailblazer ("whenever another
# creature you control with power 4 or greater enters, draw a card"), which draws.

